// Logger emits records to W. Fields are public so callers can tune
// Level/Format directly: `l.Level = log.Level.Debug`. Construct via New.
// The metadata fields (Service/Environment/Component/CorrelationID) are
// optional — when non-empty they are attached to every record this logger
// writes, before any caller-supplied key/value pairs. The persistent Fields
// list (populated by With) rides along too, after the named metadata and
// before each call's own pairs.
